  ${CYAN}./lab model remove <key>${NC}      Remove model from config (optionally disk)

${BOLD}KIWIX COMMANDS${NC}  ${DIM}(offline library)${NC}
  ${CYAN}./lab kiwix list${NC}              List all available categories
  ${CYAN}./lab kiwix browse <category>${NC} Browse files in a category
